WEBVTT

00:02:28.349 --> 00:02:30.558
God will give you health and wealth

00:02:30.582 --> 00:02:32.405
and boundless happiness.

00:02:32.817 --> 00:02:34.292
Life is like a boomerang:

00:02:34.316 --> 00:02:35.625
if you're good,

00:02:35.649 --> 00:02:38.221
good things will always come back to you.

00:02:38.245 --> 00:02:41.649
Think positively. Speak positively.

00:02:41.673 --> 00:02:44.870
Nothing is impossible if you believe.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:49.556
I got interested in this
very American theology

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.207
when I was 18 or so,

00:02:51.231 --> 00:02:55.664
and by 25 I was traveling the country
interviewing its celebrities.

00:02:56.148 --> 00:02:59.854
I spent a decade talking to televangelists

00:02:59.878 --> 00:03:02.914
with spiritual guarantees
for divine money.